  "review_notes": [
    "Before-after pages16–17 show four32pt intact-sentence pairs. Orange facing-contour planes, inward/outward arrows, signed editorial pt values and captions are readable and make the spacing-only effect visible.",
    "Default font shaping and this book’s manual spacing experiment are explicitly distinguished. The after rows use translated glyphs with unchanged outlines and point size, not a substituted font or scaled word.",
    "Final gap-shape pages18–19 show the same three adjacent pairs located by orange underline within the full20pt sentence, with64pt contextual callouts and actual sampled void silhouettes. The full phrase remains intact; callouts are explanatory details.",
    "Final post-layout-fix extracted profiles are centered in100pt cells and clearly separated from right commentary. Sans versus Gungseo profiles visibly differ in contour and openings. No shape/commentary overlap was observed.",
    "Cover title hierarchy, centered title/bands/tearoff labels and star caption are unchanged. Backcover photo retains the complete original red oval and its right-column centering.",
    "Contents references now point to printed14–15 spacing experiments and16–17 facing-contour plates. Intro remains printed01 and contents/covers have nofolio.",
    "All12 atlas pages retain the exact whole sentence32pt, natural font dimensions and actual counter highlights. B-grade editorial impression strips and late15meme applications remain unchanged.",
    "All28 pages in the contact sheet show the intended white/black/yellow system, orange evidence on the new spreads, and no observed clipping or overlaps. Numeric QA independently reports zero actual Bézier ink clips, fits, wraps or missing glyphs.",
    "Unchanged23 pages are independently pixel-identical with B5 at120dpi, including all six approved application pages;45 prompt/neutral/selected regions are additionally pixel-identical.",
    "No actual Adobe application or physical printer was run."
  ],
